{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\ntypedef unsigned long long ull;\ntypedef __uint128_t u128;\nconst int N=505;\nint mod;\nint f[N],g[N],dp1[N][N],dp2[N][N],C[N][N];\nstruct FastMod{\n    ull b,m;\n    void init(ull x){b=x;m=ull((u128(1)<<64)/x);}\n    ull operator()(ull a) const {ull q=ull((u128(m)*a)>>64); ull r=a-q*b; return r>=b?r-b:r;}\n}M;\ninline void add(int &a,int b){a+=b;if(a>=mod)a-=mod;}\ninline ll s(int x){return 1LL*x*(x+1)/2;}\nint main(){\n    int n,m; scanf(\"%d%d%d\",&n,&m,&mod); M.init(mod);\n    for(int i=0;i<N;i++){\n        C[i][0]=1;\n        for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){\n            C[i][j]=C[i-1][j-1]+C[i-1][j];\n            if(C[i][j]>=mod) C[i][j]-=mod;\n        }\n    }\n    g[0]=1;\n    for(int i=1;i<=m;i++){\n        for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){\n            int tmp=C[i-1][j-1];\n            int coef=M(M(1LL*g[j-1]*g[i-j])*tmp);\n            add(f[i],M(M(M(1LL*f[j-1]*g[i-j]+1LL*g[j-1]*f[i-j])*(i+1))*tmp));\n            add(f[i],M((s(j-1)+s(i-j))*coef));\n            add(g[i],M(1LL*coef*(i+1)));\n        }\n    }\n    dp2[0][0]=1;\n    for(int j=0;j<=m;j++){\n        for(int i=0;i<=n;i++){\n            add(dp1[i+1][j], dp1[i][j]);\n            add(dp2[i+1][j], dp2[i][j]);\n            for(int k=1; i+k<=n && j+k<=m; k++){\n                int tmp=C[j+k][j];\n                add(dp1[i+k+1][j+k],M(M(1LL*tmp*dp1[i][j])*g[k]));\n                add(dp1[i+k+1][j+k],M(M(1LL*tmp*dp2[i][j])*f[k]));\n                add(dp2[i+k+1][j+k],M(M(1LL*tmp*dp2[i][j])*g[k]));\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",dp1[n+1][m]);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n = int(data[0])\n    m = int(data[1])\n    mod = int(data[2])\n\n    N = 505\n    # Combination table\n    C = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        C[i][0] = 1\n        for j in range(1, i + 1):\n            C[i][j] = C[i-1][j-1] + C[i-1][j]\n            if C[i][j] >= mod:\n                C[i][j] -= mod\n\n    f = [0] * N\n    g = [0] * N\n    g[0] = 1\n\n    def s(x: int) -> int:\n        return x * (x + 1) // 2\n\n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        for j in range(1, i + 1):\n            tmp = C[i-1][j-1]\n            coef = (g[j-1] * g[i-j] % mod) * tmp % mod\n            # first part of f[i]\n            term1 = (f[j-1] * g[i-j] + g[j-1] * f[i-j]) % mod\n            term1 = term1 * (i + 1) % mod\n            term1 = term1 * tmp % mod\n            f[i] = (f[i] + term1) % mod\n            # second part of f[i]\n            term2 = (s(j-1) + s(i-j)) % mod\n            term2 = term2 * coef % mod\n            f[i] = (f[i] + term2) % mod\n            # g[i]\n            g[i] = (g[i] + coef * (i + 1) % mod) % mod\n\n    dp1 = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    dp2 = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    dp2[0][0] = 1\n\n    for j in range(m + 1):\n        for i in range(n + 1):\n            dp1[i+1][j] = (dp1[i+1][j] + dp1[i][j]) % mod\n            dp2[i+1][j] = (dp2[i+1][j] + dp2[i][j]) % mod\n            k = 1\n            while i + k <= n and j + k <= m:\n                tmp = C[j+k][j]\n                dp1[i+k+1][j+k] = (dp1[i+k+1][j+k] + tmp * dp1[i][j] % mod * g[k] % mod) % mod\n                dp1[i+k+1][j+k] = (dp1[i+k+1][j+k] + tmp * dp2[i][j] % mod * f[k] % mod) % mod\n                dp2[i+k+1][j+k] = (dp2[i+k+1][j+k] + tmp * dp2[i][j] % mod * g[k] % mod) % mod\n                k += 1\n\n    print(dp1[n+1][m] % mod)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [0.0, -0.0015088851796463132, -0.33304548263549805, -1.0588997602462769, -0.31327542662620544, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -7.867782187531702e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.0023613683879375458, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.07889349013566971, 0.0, -0.0007848043460398912, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.575941264629364, -6.198863957251888e-06, 0.0, -0.0009276139317080379, -0.0002037079248111695, 0.0, -0.00020346954988781363, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.06211404874920845, -0.16022907197475433, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.008636031299829483, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0003133521240670234, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.3589766240329482e-05, -7.986990567587782e-06, 0.0, -0.048923056572675705, -0.0020136809907853603, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.3869238793849945, 0.0, -0.001293775625526905, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.2755313036905136e-05, -0.7081852555274963, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.25251254439353943, -1.5572724342346191, -0.017669878900051117, -0.7018513083457947, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.861018856492592e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.018151717260